      "description": "<p>When you first take this <strong>Skill</strong>, you gain a <strong>Hex Clock</strong> with <strong>4 sections</strong>. The Clock starts each scene empty. When you perform an attack with an <strong>arcane weapon</strong> or cast an offensive (⚡) spell, you may spend <strong>10 Hit Points</strong> to fill one section of your Hex Clock.</p><p>At the start of your turn, you may spend up to <strong>[5 × the number of filled sections of your Hex Clock]</strong> Mind Points. For every <strong>5</strong> Mind Points spent this way, deal <strong>[SL × 2]</strong> <span style=\"font-family: Signika, sans-serif\"><a class=\"content-link\" draggable=\"true\" data-link=\"\" data-uuid=\"Item.vKU8UYT6DBhgOjtE\" data-id=\"vKU8UYT6DBhgOjtE\" data-type=\"Item\" data-tooltip=\"Equippable Item Item\" aria-describedby=\"tooltip\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; user-select: text; scrollbar-width: thin; scrollbar-color: rgb(93, 20, 43) rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); cursor: pointer; --content-link-background: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.1); background-image: none !important; background-position: initial !important; background-size: initial !important; background-repeat: initial !important; background-attachment: initial !important; background-origin: initial !important; background-clip: initial !important; background-color: rgb(102, 102, 102); padding: 0px !important; border: none !important; border-radius: 2px; white-space: nowrap; word-break: break-all; color: inherit; font-weight: bold; text-decoration: underline; display: inline-flex; align-items: center; position: relative; top: 2px; text-shadow: rgb(182, 102, 210) 0px 0px 4px; font-family: Signika, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px;\"><strong><span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\">Dark</span></strong></a></span> or <span style=\"font-family: Signika, sans-serif\"><a class=\"content-link\" draggable=\"true\" data-link=\"\" data-uuid=\"Item.tDcCWc67Ary9nVxe\" data-id=\"tDcCWc67Ary9nVxe\" data-type=\"Item\" data-tooltip=\"Equippable Item Item\" aria-describedby=\"tooltip\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; user-select: text; scrollbar-width: thin; scrollbar-color: rgb(93, 20, 43) rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); cursor: pointer; --content-link-background: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.1); background-image: none !important; background-position: initial !important; background-size: initial !important; background-repeat: initial !important; background-attachment: initial !important; background-origin: initial !important; background-clip: initial !important; background-color: rgb(102, 102, 102); padding: 0px !important; border: none !important; border-radius: 2px; white-space: nowrap; word-break: break-all; color: inherit; font-weight: bold; text-decoration: underline; display: inline-flex; align-items: center; position: relative; top: 2px; text-shadow: rgb(102, 255, 153) 0px 0px 4px; font-family: Signika, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px;\"><strong><span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\">Poison</span></strong></a></span> damage to a creature you can see. You may choose a different creature for each instance of damage.</p>",
